# EXP-23: Market Basket Analysis, Apriori & FP-Growth Algorithm in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 23: MARKET BASKET ANALYSIS IN WEKA
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To perform Market Basket Analysis using WEKA's Apriori and FP-Growth 
   associators on supermarket retail transaction dataset.

2. WEKA ARFF DATASET (market_basket_exp23.arff):
----------------------------------------------------------------------
@relation market_basket_transactions

@attribute Milk {f, t}
@attribute Beer {f, t}
@attribute Diapers {f, t}
@attribute Bread {f, t}
@attribute Butter {f, t}
@attribute Cookies {f, t}

@data
t, t, t, f, f, f
t, f, f, t, t, f
t, f, t, f, f, t
f, f, f, t, t, t
f, t, t, f, f, t
t, f, t, t, t, f
f, f, t, t, t, f
f, t, t, f, f, f
t, f, t, t, t, f
f, t, f, f, f, t
----------------------------------------------------------------------

3. WEKA EXECUTION PROCEDURE:
   a. Load market_basket_exp23.arff into WEKA Explorer.
   b. Select Associate -> Apriori / FPGrowth.
   c. Parameters: lowerBoundMinSupport = 0.30 (min_sup = 3), minMetric = 0.60 (min_conf = 60%).
   d. Run execution.

